---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About / 关于本站 — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="About QCSunny Lab: an engineering blog and a collection of 40+ free, client-side, zero-telemetry browser tools."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="about-main">
			<!-- ENGLISH VERSION -->
			<div class="i18n-en">
				<h1>About QCSunny Lab</h1>
				<p class="about-lead">
					I'm <strong>QCSunny</strong> — a software engineer focused on modern Web technologies, algorithm design,
					and developer productivity tools. QCSunny Lab is a hybrid digital space comprising an
					<strong>in-depth engineering blog</strong> and a comprehensive suite of
					<strong>40+ free, browser-native developer and financial utilities</strong>.
				</p>

				<h2>Core Philosophy & Design Principles</h2>
				<div class="about-features">
					<div class="about-feature-card">
						<div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
						<div class="feature-content">
							<strong>100% Client-Side Privacy</strong>
							<p>Every calculation, formatting, conversion, and decoding runs strictly inside your browser's JavaScript runtime. Zero tracking cookies, zero server-side telemetry, and zero uploaded source code or financial records. Once loaded, tools work seamlessly offline.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-feature-card">
						<div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
						<div class="feature-content">
							<strong>Zero Dependency Bloat</strong>
							<p>Handcrafted using modern standard Web APIs and custom lightweight state machines instead of bulky third-party libraries. Sub-50ms instant loading with tiny payload sizes.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-feature-card">
						<div class="feature-icon">🌐</div>
						<div class="feature-content">
							<strong>Free, Open & Accessible</strong>
							<p>No paywalls, no mandatory logins, and no usage caps. Built for developers, students, researchers, and everyday users who appreciate clean, distraction-free tools.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h2>What You Will Find Here</h2>
				<ul class="about-list">
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/tools/">Developer Utilities</a></strong>: High-speed JSON / SQL / HTML / CSS / XML formatters, JWT decoders, URL parser, Base64 converter, UUID v4/v7 and secure password generators, QR code maker, and Markdown live editor.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/finance/">Financial & Tax Calculators</a></strong>: Comprehensive mortgage comparison with prepayment planning, IRR & loan installment truth analyzers, compound interest projections, and personal income tax calculators.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/calculators/">Mathematical & Scientific Tools</a></strong>: Standard & scientific calculators, graphing utilities, fraction & percentage solvers, and precision unit converters.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/blog/">Engineering Blog</a></strong>: Detailed articles exploring algorithm internals, financial mathematical models, Web architecture, and practical engineering reflections.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Open Source & Contact</h2>
				<p>
					The source code for this site is open and hosted on
					<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
					Bug reports, feature requests, and suggestions are always welcome via
					<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Issues</a>.
				</p>
				<p>
					For general inquiries, collaboration, or feedback, you can reach me directly by email at:
					<a href="mailto:admin@qcsunny.org">admin@qcsunny.org</a>.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- CHINESE VERSION -->
			<div class="i18n-zh">
				<h1>关于本站 (QCSunny Lab)</h1>
				<p class="about-lead">
					我是 <strong>QCSunny</strong>，一名专注于现代 Web 开发、算法设计与效率工具的软件工程师。QCSunny Lab 是我的个人技术手记与在线工具实验室，由两部分组成：
					<strong>深度技术工程手记</strong>与一套持续迭代演进的
					<strong>40+ 款完全免费的纯前端离线开发者与金融计算工具箱</strong>。
				</p>

				<h2>核心理念与设计原则</h2>
				<div class="about-features">
					<div class="about-feature-card">
						<div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
						<div class="feature-content">
							<strong>100% 浏览器本地计算 · 零隐私上传</strong>
							<p>所有计算、排版、格式化、编解码均在你的浏览器 JavaScript 引擎中本地完成。零追踪 Cookie、零服务器埋点、不留存任何代码与财务输入。页面载入后即便断网亦可顺畅使用。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-feature-card">
						<div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
						<div class="feature-content">
							<strong>极致轻量 · 拒绝臃肿框架</strong>
							<p>完全基于现代标准 Web API 与手写原生状态机构建，拒绝引入体积庞大的冗余第三方依赖。整体打包体积以 KB 计量，带来 sub-50ms 极速毫秒级加载体验。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="about-feature-card">
						<div class="feature-icon">🌐</div>
						<div class="feature-content">
							<strong>完全免费 · 开放免登</strong>
							<p>无需注册账户、无付费门槛、无频次限制，为开发者、科研学生、职场人士提供纯净、无打扰的高效工具环境。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h2>站点内容概览</h2>
				<ul class="about-list">
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/tools/">开发者实用工具</a></strong>：毫秒级 JSON / SQL / HTML / CSS / XML 格式化美化、JWT 智能解码分析、URL 参数解析、Base64 编解码、UUID (v4/v7) 与强密码生成器、二维码制作及 Markdown 实时预览编辑器。
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/finance/">金融与税务计算</a></strong>：等额本息/等额本金房贷对比与提前还贷测算、消费贷真实年化（IRR）揭秘、复利增长规划、个税与年终奖最优筹划。
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/calculators/">数学科学与单位换算</a></strong>：科学计算器、函数图像绘制、分数/百分比运算，以及涵盖长度、重量、速度、能量、压强等多维度的精准单位转换器。
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong><a href="/blog/">技术博客与工程手记</a></strong>：深度拆解核心算法原理、金融复利与房贷推导数学模型、数据库架构优化（如 UUID 对比）以及现代 Web 开发技术沉淀。
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>开源与联系方式</h2>
				<p>
					本站源码完全公开开源，托管于
					<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>。
					若在使用过程中发现任何问题或有新工具需求，非常欢迎在
					<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Issues</a> 中提交反馈。
				</p>
				<p>
					商务合作、技术交流或建议咨询，可通过电子邮箱直接与我联系：
					<a href="mailto:admin@qcsunny.org">admin@qcsunny.org</a>。
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<script is:inline>
			(() => {
				const titles = {
					en: 'About — QCSunny Lab',
					zh: '关于本站 — QCSunny Lab'
				};
				function syncTitle(lang) {
					document.title = titles[lang] || titles.zh;
				}
				const cur = document.documentElement.dataset.lang || localStorage.getItem('site:lang') || 'zh';
				syncTitle(cur);
				window.addEventListener('site:lang-change', (e) => {
					syncTitle(e.detail);
				});
			})();
		</script>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-main {
		max-width: min(46rem, calc(100% - 2.5rem));
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
		font-size: 1.02rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--fg);
	}
	h1 {
		color: var(--fg);
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.3rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 0.8em;
	}
	h2 {
		color: var(--fg);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-top: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 0.8em;
		padding-bottom: 0.3em;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
	}
	.about-lead {
		font-size: 1.12rem;
		line-height: 1.85;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
	}
	a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}
	a:hover {
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	.about-features {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin: 1.2em 0 1.8em;
	}
	.about-feature-card {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
		background: rgba(125, 144, 255, 0.05);
		border: 1px solid var(--gridline);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
	}
	.feature-icon {
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		line-height: 1;
		padding-top: 0.1em;
	}
	.feature-content strong {
		display: block;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.3em;
		color: var(--fg);
	}
	.feature-content p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--dim);
	}
	.about-list {
		padding-left: 1.4rem;
		margin: 1.2em 0 1.8em;
	}
	.about-list li {
		margin-bottom: 0.8em;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.about-list strong {
		color: var(--fg);
	}
</style>
